    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344580/extras/0e9a79ee62b004160106f9012102e491.poster.avif?t=1754783732\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344580/extras/0e9a79ee62b004160106f9012102e491.webm?t=1754783732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344580/extras/0e9a79ee62b004160106f9012102e491.mp4?t=1754783732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a Village with Animal Companions</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own village and recruit cute animal villagers to create a thriving community in the wasteland. Keep your villagers happy and satisfied by meeting their needs and watch them work hard for you in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344580/extras/eaa2dd821007dc9059c957774f73d731.poster.avif?t=1754783732\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344580/extras/eaa2dd821007dc9059c957774f73d731.webm?t=1754783732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344580/extras/eaa2dd821007dc9059c957774f73d731.mp4?t=1754783732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Vast Game World</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into a procedurally generated world alongside your animal companions. Gather diverse resources across different biomes and uncover the ruins of ancient civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344580/extras/8826c2f17216c97e17cd3c517296cea6.poster.avif?t=1754783732\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344580/extras/8826c2f17216c97e17cd3c517296cea6.webm?t=1754783732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344580/extras/8826c2f17216c97e17cd3c517296cea6.mp4?t=1754783732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Unexpected Events and Challenges</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is ever-changing! Be prepared to face various events and challenges with your companions: raider camps, mysterious dungeons, colossal mutated creatures, and other opportunity-filled yet perilous locations await your exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344580/extras/104887bf06515d8b509f6c275f3ec6a6.poster.avif?t=1754783732\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344580/extras/104887bf06515d8b509f6c275f3ec6a6.webm?t=1754783732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344580/extras/104887bf06515d8b509f6c275f3ec6a6.mp4?t=1754783732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Through Technological Research</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your village to expand the adventure area, recruit special companions, and unlock new buildings through research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The possibilities are endless in Runai!</strong></p>",
